{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團防彈少年團（BTS）所屬事務所HYBE旗下子公司HYBE JAPAN，昨日(18日)宣布成功收購日本KeyHolder事務所的50.1%股權，進一步擴大在日本娛樂市場的影響力。</p><p>KeyHolder旗下藝人包括曾演經典日劇《交響情人夢》的男星玉木宏、偶像女團乃木坂46與SKE48，以及今年8月曾來港開騷的人氣樂隊Novelbright等。消息公布後，Novelbright主音竹中雄大，轉貼相關報道並搞笑留言：「不知不覺變成HYBE JAPAN所屬了。」又配上哈哈笑的emoji。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.205146+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":252,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01:09:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T20:36:44.896216+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:48:14.275670+00:00","content_hash":"30363cdc6ca4303429be56f8ef10cc9f3060e5ee96144e358a6fb41b27096760","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:54:53.205146+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}